; c16-4t-two-of-three. Anchor: shot-0232 (Ch. 16, four trumps).
; Printed: 0.52 (14 of 27 placements).
; Claim: with four trumps, the double among them but neither the second nor
;   the third highest, some opponent holds at least two of the three missing
;   trumps and so keeps one past the double.
; State: the bidder's seven tiles, nothing played; the 21 others dealt
;   uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 47/95. Book model: 14/27.
(query (roles (chair v) (chair x) (domino a) (domino b))
  (out)
  (pattern
    (viewer v)
    (opponent v x)
    (in a q*)
    (in b q*)
    (holds x a)
    (holds x b)))
